[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4080.47, "timestamp": "01:08:00", "text": "我们会亲自给你奖励。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4082.309, "timestamp": "01:08:02", "text": "奖励是什么？告诉我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4084.23, "timestamp": "01:08:04", "text": "你知道如果你杀了人会得到什么奖励吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4086.309, "timestamp": "01:08:06", "text": "拉格诺瑟，你可以保留他的胸甲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4088.549, "timestamp": "01:08:08", "text": "你可以给他穿上胸甲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4091.75, "timestamp": "01:08:11", "text": "不错，它是一件菱形胸甲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4094.789, "timestamp": "01:08:14", "text": "达格诺瑟戴的那件是你的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4098.47, "timestamp": "01:08:18", "text": "对，一切都是我的，好吗？听着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4102.63, "timestamp": "01:08:22", "text": "没错，如果你能干掉拉格纳瑟的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4105.11, "timestamp": "01:08:25", "text": "别听他的。他在耍花招。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4107.43, "timestamp": "01:08:27", "text": "我应该保护……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4109.92, "timestamp": "01:08:29", "text": "世界。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4117.63, "timestamp": "01:08:37", "text": "我应该扮演保护者的角色。你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4121.39, "timestamp": "01:08:41", "text": "并非直接拒绝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4125.99, "timestamp": "01:08:45", "text": "脸。没有。做梦吧，兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4129.189, "timestamp": "01:08:49", "text": "这就是我看不见的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4130.349, "timestamp": "01:08:50", "text": "在电话里"}]